# Leering Onlooker: "{2}{B}{B}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create two tapped 1/1 black Bat creature tokens with flying." (CR 602.2, 111.2, 701.13a) It has flying. On turn 1 the
# Onlooker is on the battlefield and Bot1 has {2}{B}{B} of mana, yet the ability is refused there (it can only be activated from the graveyard, CR 113.6, 602.2). Bot2 Bolts it on turn 2;
# on turn 3 Bot1 pays {2}{B}{B} and exiles it from the graveyard for two tapped Bats, and the Onlooker is in exile, not the graveyard.

